            "sid": "EST 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino, bulizi bwamusimbi umwi aumwi bwasika kuti anjile kumwami Ahasuera, musule lyakucitilwa mbuli mbokulaililwa kubakaintu, mwaka woonse (mboobu mbobakalibambila: myezi musanu aumwi amafuta amuro, amyezi musanu aumwi azinunkilizyo amwiimpula), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbombuboobu wakaboola musimbi kumwami; ulapegwa cipanzi ncayanda kuzwa muŋanda yabakaintu kuti kanjila muŋanda yamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakaya mangolezya akujokela mafumofumo kuŋanda yabili yabakaintu kuli-Syasyagazi siŋanda wamwami, mulangi wabasimamambe. Takwakaya alimwi kumwami, cita mwami wakamuyanda akumwiita izina lyakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
