                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo naakaletwa kumwami Ahasuera muŋanda yabwami, mumwezi wakumi uutegwa Tebeta, mumwaka wasanu aibili wabulelo bwakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
