        {
          "text": "mwami wakayanda Esita kwiinda bakaintu bakwe boonse, alimwi walo wakajana luse azipo zyakwe kwiinda basimbi boonse; wakabika munsini wabwami amutwe wakwe akumucita namalelo mucilao ca-Vasiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
